  "label": "Islamophobia",
  "description": "A fear or prejudice against Islam and Muslims, often manifesting as stereotypes, discrimination, or hostility. It can include the belief that Islam is inherently violent or incompatible with Western values, or that Muslims are more likely to engage in terrorism. This is a form of systemic discrimination that can lead to social exclusion, hate crimes, and policy discrimination against Muslim communities.",
